{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"451300ae-3d5c-4ef4-8165-27729165177b","ts":"2026-05-17T08:46:41.627-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"31","nodeName":"Ollama Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG-Pipeline-&-Chatbot","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"f-j_TIn3ewVBNcN17AuYC","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: what is the cut-off time policy of the company?\\nAI: Calling Pinecone Vector Store1 with input: {\\\"input\\\":\\\"cut-off time policy\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"5bfeb252-33e2-4144-9fc6-8550801929de\\\"}\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"If your delivery exceeds the guaranteed timeline by more than 2 business days, you may request a shipping fee refund or a $10 store credit. If the delay exceeds 10 business days, you are eligible for a full order cancellation and refund, even if the item is still in transit.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ4: Do you deliver to PO Boxes or military addresses?\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nStandard delivery to PO Boxes is available in Zones A and B via USPS partners. Express and same-day delivery require a physical street address. APO/FPO/DPO military addresses are supported for standard shipping only; delivery timelines range from 10–21 business days.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ5: How are delivery times calculated for pre-order items?\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThe delivery countdown begins on the date the item is released and dispatched from our warehouse, NOT the date of order placement. Pre-order items are shipped via the method selected at checkout, but express options are only activated once inventory is physically available.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ6: Are there any items excluded from discounts?\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":646,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":656,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"30a385ad-c10c-4bcb-9f7c-cfbc91139097\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"First-time customer codes (e.g., WELCOME15) are valid for 30 days after account creation and apply only to the first completed order.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nAbuse, including creating multiple accounts to redeem first-time offers, results in order cancellation, account suspension, and forfeiture of rewards.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n4.5 Price Match Policy\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora will match the price of identical items sold by major competitors (Amazon, Walmart, Target, Best Buy) if the lower price is verifiable at checkout.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPrice matches must be requested before order placement and exclude marketplace/third-party sellers, auction sites, and membership-only pricing.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nIf a price drop occurs within 7 days of purchase, customers may request a partial refund of the difference via the Price Protection form.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n5. PAYMENT METHODS & BILLING\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nAccepted Methods: Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Nexora Store Credit, and Buy-Now-Pay-Later (Klarna, Afterpay).\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":412,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":426,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"0a603336-d95e-419e-86f0-969193b733fa\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Discounts apply to the subtotal BEFORE taxes and shipping fees, unless explicitly stated otherwise.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nItems marked 'Clearance,' 'Final Sale,' or 'Non-Returnable' are excluded from percentage discounts but may be eligible for fixed-amount vouchers if the voucher terms permit.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nEmployee discounts (25% off) cannot be combined with any other offer and are limited to $5,000 in discounted purchases per calendar year.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n4.3 Minimum Purchase Requirements\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n$10 off vouchers require a minimum spend of $75.00.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n$25 off vouchers require a minimum spend of $150.00.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n$50 off vouchers require a minimum spend of $300.00.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nFree shipping discounts override zone-based thresholds but do not waive oversized handling fees.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n4.4 Promo Code Validity & Restrictions\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPromotional codes are case-sensitive and must be entered at checkout. Retroactive application is not permitted.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCodes expire at 11:59 PM UTC on the stated end date. Early termination may occur if inventory caps are reached.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":390,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":410,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"2fce79f7-1f2b-48ed-ab4f-2eb90a4fcc0c\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Orders may be cancelled without penalty if the status is still 'Processing.' Once the status changes to 'Picked' or 'Shipped,' cancellation is no longer possible. You may refuse delivery or initiate a return after receipt. Custom and made-to-order items cannot be cancelled once production begins (usually within 6 hours of order confirmation).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ17: Why was my discount code rejected at checkout?\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCommon reasons include: (a) the code has expired; (b) the cart contains excluded items; (c) the minimum purchase threshold was not met; (d) the code was already used on a previous order; (e) you attempted to stack it with another promotional code. Contact support with a screenshot for manual review if you believe the rejection was in error.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ18: Do you ship internationally, and who pays customs duties?\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":698,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":704,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"1c6121e6-2534-4ea9-99b4-b28ebe844cbb\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"The provided information does not explicitly mention a \\\"cut-off time policy\\\" for the company. However, it does include details about delivery timelines, order cancellation policies, and promotional code validity, which may be relevant depending on your specific context.\\n\\nIf you are referring to cut-off times for placing orders (e.g., to ensure same-day or next-day shipping), this information is not directly available in the retrieved data. You may need to check the company’s shipping or FAQ section for more precise details.\\n\\nLet me know if you’d like assistance with anything else!\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":111,\"promptTokens\":1223,\"totalTokens\":1334}}}"}}
