{"__type":"$$EventMessageConfirm","confirm":"6cca3a3b-ce8f-4b69-900c-96ceae0416b0","ts":"2026-05-17T08:52:38.886-04:00","source":{"id":"0","name":"eventBus"}}
{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"cd3110ce-b456-4054-9c7b-74ad4499b24a","ts":"2026-05-17T08:52:38.889-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"32","nodeName":"Ollama Chat Model","workflowName":"RAG-Pipeline-&-Chatbot","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOllama","workflowId":"f-j_TIn3ewVBNcN17AuYC","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"System: You are a helpful assistant of the copmany, people wil contact you to get the help for technicalities relted to company matters, you can have a help from tool for provided policy and FAQ guidance and provide them complete answer with confidence.\\nHuman: what are the technicalities involve in company policy in processing a order?\\nAI: Calling Pinecone Vector Store1 with input: {\\\"input\\\":\\\"technicalities involved in company policy for processing an order\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"518f3a05-105e-48b4-bd18-ae051d442ad1\\\"}\\nTool: [{\\\"response\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Currency: All transactions are processed in USD. International customers bear any foreign exchange fees imposed by their card issuer.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nTaxation: Sales tax is calculated based on the delivery address and applicable state/local rates. Tax-exempt organizations must submit a valid resale certificate before checkout.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPre-Orders: A 20% deposit is required to reserve pre-order items. The remaining balance is charged 2 business days before dispatch. Cancellations before the balance charge receive a full deposit refund; cancellations after the balance charge incur a 10% restocking fee.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n6. PRIVACY & DATA PROTECTION\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora collects personal data necessary for order fulfillment, fraud prevention, and personalized marketing. Data categories include name, address, contact details, payment tokens, and purchase history.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCustomer data is retained for 7 years after the last transaction to comply with tax and accounting regulations, after which it is anonymized or securely destroyed.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":428,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":438,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"155b7e99-0fdc-42c2-beb1-604f51ec353b\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"NEXORA E-COMMERCE STORE\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nPolicy, Terms & Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) DocumentVersion 2.1 | Effective Date: May 16, 2026\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n1. ABOUT NEXORA\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora is a multi-category online retail platform offering electronics, fashion, home essentials, beauty products, and specialty goods. This document governs all transactions conducted through the Nexora website (www.nexora.example) and mobile applications. By placing an order, customers agree to the policies outlined herein.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n2. SHIPPING & DELIVERY POLICY\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n2.1 Delivery Zones & Coverage\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora operates three primary delivery zones: Zone A (Metropolitan/Within 50km of fulfillment centers), Zone B (Suburban/50–150km), and Zone C (Remote/150km+ or special regions).\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nZone A coverage includes all postal codes beginning with prefixes 10–19, 20–29, and 30–35. Zone B includes prefixes 36–55. Zone C includes prefixes 56–99 and select offshore territories.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":274,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":288,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"cdef7324-5a75-4cf9-a859-847b6516b35e\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"We ship to 42 countries. The customer is responsible for all import duties, taxes, and customs clearance fees levied by the destination country. These charges are NOT included in the Nexora checkout total and are collected by the carrier or local customs office upon delivery.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ19: What is your policy on bulk or wholesale orders?\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nOrders exceeding 20 units of a single SKU are flagged as bulk purchases. Retail promotional codes do not apply. Bulk buyers should contact wholesale@nexora.example for tiered pricing, separate invoicing, and freight shipping quotes.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nQ20: How can I contact Nexora customer support?\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nLive Chat: Available 24/7 on the website and app.Email: support@nexora.example (response within 4 business hours).Phone: 1-800-NEXORA-1 (1-800-639-6721), Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM – 10:00 PM EST; Saturday–Sunday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM EST.Mail: Nexora Customer Relations, 4500 Commerce Parkway, Wilmington, DE 19809.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":706,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":714,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"09522909-10f6-4181-81ef-af450820fe81\\\\\\\"}\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"pageContent\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Nexora does not sell personal data to third parties. Selected data is shared with logistics partners and payment processors strictly for operational purposes.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCustomers may request a full data export or deletion (subject to legal retention requirements) by contacting privacy@nexora.example.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n7. TERMS OF SERVICE\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nCustomers must be at least 18 years of age or have guardian consent to create an account and place orders.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora reserves the right to cancel orders suspected of fraudulent activity, bulk purchasing for resale (without wholesale authorization), or pricing errors exceeding 30% below intended value.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nProduct descriptions and images are provided for reference. Minor color variations due to display calibration do not constitute grounds for return.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nNexora's liability for any order is limited to the purchase price paid. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"metadata\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"blobType\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"loc.lines.from\\\\\\\":440,\\\\\\\"loc.lines.to\\\\\\\":452,\\\\\\\"source\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"blob\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"da8ff2a3-16f8-41fa-9fc8-c702da761c5d\\\\\\\"}\\\"}]}]\"],\"options\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"not_implemented\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"chat_models\",\"ollama\",\"ChatOllama\"]},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"Here are the key technicalities involved in Nexora's company policy for processing an order:\\n\\n### 1. **Currency & Payment Processing**\\n- All transactions are processed in **USD**.\\n- International customers are responsible for any **foreign exchange fees** imposed by their card issuer.\\n\\n### 2. **Taxation**\\n- Sales tax is calculated based on the **delivery address** and applicable state/local rates.\\n- Tax-exempt organizations must submit a **valid resale certificate** before checkout.\\n\\n### 3. **Pre-Orders**\\n- A **20% deposit** is required to reserve pre-order items.\\n- The remaining balance is charged **2 business days before dispatch**.\\n- Cancellations before the balance charge receive a **full deposit refund**.\\n- Cancellations after the balance charge incur a **10% restocking fee**.\\n\\n### 4. **Shipping & Delivery**\\n- Nexora operates three delivery zones:\\n  - **Zone A**: Metropolitan areas (within 50km of fulfillment centers).\\n  - **Zone B**: Suburban areas (50–150km).\\n  - **Zone C**: Remote areas (150km+ or special regions).\\n- Ships to **42 countries**; customers are responsible for **import duties, taxes, and customs clearance fees** not included in the checkout total.\\n\\n### 5. **Bulk or Wholesale Orders**\\n- Orders exceeding **20 units** of a single SKU are flagged as bulk purchases.\\n- Retail promotional codes **do not apply**.\\n- Bulk buyers should contact **wholesale@nexora.example** for tiered pricing, separate invoicing, and freight shipping quotes.\\n\\n### 6. **Privacy & Data Protection**\\n- Nexora collects personal data necessary for order fulfillment, fraud prevention, and personalized marketing.\\n- Data categories include name, address, contact details, payment tokens, and purchase history.\\n- Customer data is retained for **7 years** after the last transaction for compliance with tax and accounting regulations, then anonymized or securely destroyed.\\n- Nexora does **not sell personal data** to third parties; data is shared only with logistics partners and payment processors for operational purposes.\\n- Customers may request a full data export or deletion (subject to legal retention requirements) by contacting **privacy@nexora.example**.\\n\\n### 7. **Terms of Service**\\n- Customers must be at least **18 years of age** or have guardian consent to create an account and place orders.\\n- Nexora reserves the right to cancel orders suspected of:\\n  - Fraudulent activity.\\n  - Bulk purchasing for resale without wholesale authorization.\\n  - Pricing errors exceeding **30% below intended value**.\\n- Product descriptions and images are for reference; minor color variations due to display calibration do not constitute grounds for return.\\n- Nexora’s liability for any order is limited to the **purchase price paid**. They are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.\\n\\n### 8. **Customer Support**\\n- **Live Chat**: Available 24/7 on the website and app.\\n- **Email**: support@nexora.example (response within 4 business hours).\\n- **Phone**: 1-800-NEXORA-1 (1-800-639-6721), Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM – 10:00 PM EST; Saturday–Sunday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM EST.\\n- **Mail**: Nexora Customer Relations, 4500 Commerce Parkway, Wilmington, DE 19809.\\n\\nThese policies ensure smooth order processing while protecting both the customer and Nexora’s operational integrity. If you have further questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out via the provided support channels!\"}]]},\"tokenUsageEstimate\":{\"completionTokens\":752,\"promptTokens\":1292,\"totalTokens\":2044}}}"}}
